      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:pistissophia.2.petermann:109-114",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲁⲩⲱ ϣⲁϥϥⲓ ⲧⲉⲩϭⲟⲙ ⲉⲧⲛϩⲏⲧⲟⲩ · ⲙⲛⲡⲛⲓϥⲉ ⲛⲧⲉⲩⲧⲁⲡⲣⲟ · ⲁⲩⲱ ⲙⲛⲙⲙⲟⲩⲉⲓⲟⲟⲩⲉ ⲛⲛⲉⲩⲃⲁⲗ · ⲁⲩⲱ ⲙⲛⲛ**ϥⲱⲧⲉ** ⲛⲛⲉⲩⲥⲱⲙⲁ ·",
      "english": "and he [sc. the hastener] carried away their power which was in them and the breath of their mouth and the tears [lit. waters] of their eyes and the sweat of their bodies.",
